WEBVTT

00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:13.833
Bottom line: recommend sending a focused cross-functional team to PPCC 2026 with one objective: return with a governed AI, app, and automation pilot proposal.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:17.700
This is a recommendation, not a measured outcome.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:24.167
Treat the event as a structured learning sprint for business, platform, data, and risk leaders.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:30.567
PPCC runs October 27 through 29 at the MGM Grand in Las Vegas.

00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:36.167
Applied workshops run before and after the main conference.

00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:42.267
Microsoft frames PPCC around Copilot, agents, apps, automation, and data.

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:50.000
The program connects those capabilities to trusted data, implementation, architecture, and governance.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
That is the bridge from innovation ambition to execution controls.

00:00:55.567 --> 00:01:04.533
After the event, require one pilot charter naming the workflow, owner, trusted data, guardrails, and a testable success measure.

00:01:04.533 --> 00:01:08.600
Expand only when that evidence supports the next decision.
